{"id":"81e4e07c044271fb","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-comb-delta-system.md","title":"ZFC Comb Delta System","display":"df-zfc-comb-delta-system — ZFC Comb Delta System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb-delta-system","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb-delta-system","58-df-zfc-comb-root-of-delta-system","58-df-zfc-comb5-delta-system","58-df-zfc-comb5-delta-root","58-df-zfc-comb7-delta-system","58-df-zfc-comb8-delta-system"],"display":"df-zfc-comb-delta-system — ZFC Comb Delta System","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-intersection]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb-delta-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb-delta-system</span><span>58-df-zfc-comb-root-of-delta-system</span><span>58-df-zfc-comb5-delta-system</span><span>58-df-zfc-comb5-delta-root</span><span>58-df-zfc-comb7-delta-system</span><span>58-df-zfc-comb8-delta-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb-delta-system — ZFC Comb Delta System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fde8356a8733e94f\" href=\"?note=fde8356a8733e94f\" title=\"58-df-intersection\">58-df-intersection</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A,r\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal A,r\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCombDeltaSystem}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCombDeltaSystem}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}delta\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCombDeltaSystem}_S(\\mathcal A,r)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(r\\subseteq A)\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\rightarrow A\\cap B=r)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}delta\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCombDeltaSystem}_S(\\mathcal A,r)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(r\\subseteq A)\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\rightarrow A\\cap B=r)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The root is explicitly contained in every member, so singleton delta-systems no longer leave <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> unconstrained.</li>\n<li>The legacy note labels remain frontmatter aliases; the formal atom defines only the canonical delta-system predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-intersection","status":"resolved","id":"fde8356a8733e94f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-intersection]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A,r\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCombDeltaSystem}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}delta\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCombDeltaSystem}_S(\\mathcal A,r)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(r\\subseteq A)\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\rightarrow A\\cap B=r)","display":true},{"tex":"r","display":false}],"bytes":1155,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1637","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-comb-delta-system.md|58-df-zfc-comb-delta-system]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","fde8356a8733e94f"]}